<space dim="horizontal"/> <hi rendition="#aq">Day, Croskey &amp; Ross</hi> in <hi rendition="#g">Southampton</hi>.<lb/>
<space dim="horizontal"/> <hi rendition="#aq">Wm. Iselin</hi> in <hi rendition="#g">Havre</hi>.<lb/>
<space dim="horizontal"/> <hi rendition="#g">Preis der Passage:</hi> Ld'or <abbr>Rl.</abbr> 195.</p><lb/>
